<title>GERMANY: BHF ups Veba to buy on Degussa.</title>
<headline>BHF ups Veba to buy on Degussa.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BHF Bank said on Wednesday it had raised its recommendation on utility group Veba AG to buy from hold on news that Veba plans to acquire a 36.4 percent stake in chemicals and metals group Degussa AG.</p>
<p>Utilities analyst Thomas Deser said he had raised his earnings estimates for Veba by ten pfennings to 5.70 marks per share in 1997 and by ten pfennigs to 6.30 marks in 1998 following the news.</p>
<p>Deser said he welcomed the news as a signal that Veba was moving into a new phase in its activities and he expected further acquisitions to follow, also in the trading, services and electricity sectors.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
